@startuml Netty Channel 和线程机制时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

participant "业务线程\n(main/worker)" as BusinessThread
participant "NettyRemotingClient" as RpcClient
participant "Channel\n(客户端)" as ClientChannel
participant "TCP 连接" as TCP
participant "Channel\n(服务端)" as ServerChannel
participant "JdkDynamicServerHandler" as ServerHandler
participant "MethodInvoker" as Invoker
participant "EventLoop 线程\n(NettyClientThread)" as EventLoopThread
participant "NettyClientHandler" as ClientHandler
participant "ResponseFuture" as Future
participant "CountDownLatch" as Latch

== 阶段1: 建立连接 ==

note over BusinessThread, ServerChannel
  **问题1：Channel 是同一个吗？**
  
  客户端和服务端的 Channel 是同一个 TCP 连接的两端
  可以双向通信
end note

BusinessThread -> RpcClient: sendSync(request)
activate RpcClient

RpcClient -> RpcClient: getOrCreateChannel(host)
RpcClient -> ClientChannel: bootstrap.connect(host, port)
activate ClientChannel

ClientChannel -> TCP: 建立 TCP 连接
activate TCP
TCP -> ServerChannel: accept() 创建新连接
activate ServerChannel
note right of ServerChannel
  **服务端接收连接**
  创建新的 SocketChannel
  这个 Channel 和客户端的 Channel
  是同一个 TCP 连接的两端
end note

ServerChannel --> TCP: 连接建立
TCP --> ClientChannel: 连接建立
ClientChannel --> RpcClient: Channel 对象
deactivate ClientChannel
deactivate TCP
deactivate ServerChannel

== 阶段2: 客户端发送请求 ==

RpcClient -> Future: new ResponseFuture(opaque, timeout)
activate Future
Future -> Latch: new CountDownLatch(1)
activate Latch
Latch --> Future: 创建完成
deactivate Latch
Future --> RpcClient: ResponseFuture
deactivate Future

RpcClient -> ClientChannel: writeAndFlush(request)
activate ClientChannel
note right of ClientChannel
  **客户端通过 Channel 发送请求**
  请求包含 opaque = 1
end note

ClientChannel -> TCP: 发送数据（TCP）
activate TCP
TCP -> ServerChannel: 接收数据（TCP）
activate ServerChannel
ServerChannel --> TCP: 数据接收完成
deactivate ServerChannel
TCP --> ClientChannel: 发送完成
deactivate TCP
deactivate ClientChannel

RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse()
activate Future
Future -> Latch: await(timeout)
activate Latch
note right of Latch
  **业务线程阻塞在这里**
  CountDownLatch.await()
  等待 EventLoop 线程唤醒
end note

Future --> RpcClient: (阻塞等待)
deactivate Future
deactivate Latch

== 阶段3: 服务端处理请求 ==

ServerChannel -> ServerHandler: channelRead(Transporter)
activate ServerHandler
note right of ServerHandler
  **服务端通过同一个 Channel 接收请求**
  ctx.channel() 就是客户端连接时创建的 Channel
  它们共享同一个 TCP 连接
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 提取 opaque = 1
ServerHandler -> Invoker: methodInvoker.invoke(args)
activate Invoker
Invoker -> Invoker: 执行方法调用
Invoker --> ServerHandler: result
deactivate Invoker

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 构建响应
note right of ServerHandler
  **响应包含相同的 opaque = 1**
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerChannel: writeAndFlush(response)
activate ServerChannel
note right of ServerChannel
  **服务端通过同一个 Channel 发送响应**
  这个 Channel 和客户端的 Channel
  是同一个 TCP 连接
end note

ServerChannel -> TCP: 发送数据（TCP）
activate TCP
TCP -> ClientChannel: 接收数据（TCP）
activate ClientChannel
ClientChannel --> TCP: 数据接收完成
deactivate ClientChannel
TCP --> ServerChannel: 发送完成
deactivate TCP
deactivate ServerChannel
ServerHandler --> ServerChannel: 处理完成
deactivate ServerHandler

== 阶段4: 客户端接收响应 ==

note over BusinessThread, Latch
  **问题2：线程是同一个吗？**
  
  不是！业务线程和 EventLoop 线程是不同的线程
  通过 CountDownLatch 进行线程间通信
end note

ClientChannel -> EventLoopThread: channelRead(Transporter)
activate EventLoopThread
note right of EventLoopThread
  **EventLoop 线程处理网络 I/O**
  线程名：NettyClientThread-1
  这是 Netty 的 I/O 线程，不是业务线程
end note

EventLoopThread -> ClientHandler: processReceived(transporter)
activate ClientHandler

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 提取 opaque = 1
ClientHandler -> Future: getFuture(opaque=1)
activate Future
Future --> ClientHandler: ResponseFuture
deactivate Future

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 反序列化响应
ClientHandler -> Future: putResponse(response)
activate Future

Future -> Future: this.iRpcResponse = response
Future -> Latch: countDown()
activate Latch
note right of Latch
  **EventLoop 线程唤醒业务线程**
  CountDownLatch.countDown()
  唤醒等待的业务线程
end note

Latch -> BusinessThread: 唤醒业务线程
note right of BusinessThread
  **业务线程被唤醒**
  从 waitResponse() 返回
  继续执行后续代码
end note

Latch --> Future: 唤醒完成
deactivate Latch
Future -> Future: FUTURE_TABLE.remove(opaque)
Future --> ClientHandler: 响应已设置
deactivate Future

ClientHandler --> EventLoopThread: 处理完成
deactivate ClientHandler
EventLoopThread --> ClientChannel: 处理完成
deactivate EventLoopThread

== 阶段5: 业务线程获取结果 ==

BusinessThread -> Future: waitResponse() 返回
activate Future
Future --> BusinessThread: IRpcResponse
deactivate Future

BusinessThread -> RpcClient: 返回结果
RpcClient --> BusinessThread: IRpcResponse
deactivate RpcClient

== 线程模型对比 ==

note over BusinessThread
  **业务线程（调用线程）**
  - 线程名：main / worker-thread-1
  - 职责：执行业务逻辑
  - 特点：可以阻塞等待结果
  - 执行：doSendSync() → waitResponse() (阻塞)
end note

note over EventLoopThread
  **EventLoop 线程（Netty I/O 线程）**
  - 线程名：NettyClientThread-1
  - 职责：处理网络 I/O 事件
  - 特点：不能阻塞，快速处理
  - 执行：channelRead() → processReceived() → putResponse()
end note

note over Latch
  **CountDownLatch（线程同步工具）**
  - await()：业务线程阻塞等待
  - countDown()：EventLoop 线程唤醒业务线程
  - 实现线程间通信
end note

== Channel 双向通信示例 ==

note over ClientChannel, ServerChannel
  **同一个 TCP 连接，双向通信**
end note

group 客户端 → 服务端
    ClientChannel -> TCP: 发送请求
    TCP -> ServerChannel: 接收请求
end

group 服务端 → 客户端
    ServerChannel -> TCP: 发送响应
    TCP -> ClientChannel: 接收响应
end

note over ClientChannel, ServerChannel
  **关键理解：**
  
  1. 客户端和服务端的 Channel 是同一个 TCP 连接的两端
  2. 客户端可以通过 Channel 发送请求
  3. 服务端可以通过同一个 Channel 发送响应
  4. 它们共享同一个 TCP 连接，可以双向通信
end note

== 总结 ==

note over BusinessThread, Latch
  **问题1：Channel 是同一个吗？**
  ✅ 是的，客户端和服务端的 Channel 是同一个 TCP 连接的两端
  
  **问题2：线程是同一个吗？**
  ❌ 不是，业务线程和 EventLoop 线程是不同的线程
     通过 CountDownLatch 进行线程间通信
  
  **设计优势：**
  - 业务线程可以同步等待，代码简单
  - EventLoop 线程非阻塞处理 I/O，性能高
  - 通过 CountDownLatch 实现线程间通信，安全可靠
end note

@enduml
